"anything.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I just lived."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non parlavo con nessuno.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non incrociavo lo sguardo di nessuno.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Non facevo "
"niente.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Vivevo e basta."

#: scenario7:scenario7_72AEAE42_49F1_4364_B7CA_B26030FEAEFE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 496dd1afe302913e91272e7c22d6c8e0fec975e4367c9e7dd84f60d0eecf99a4
