msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_72AEAE42_49F1_4364_B7CA_B26030FEAEFE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But even though I had peace, I still feared Aimee having a change of heart. ⟪k:1⟫I trembled "
"at the possibility that one day it might be ⟪k:2⟫her⟪k:3⟫ that opened the door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma sebbene avessi ottenuto la pace, temevo ancora che Aimee potesse avere un ripensamento. "
"⟪k:1⟫Tremavo al pensiero che un giorno avrebbe potuto essere ⟪k:2⟫lei⟪k:3⟫ ad aprire la porta."

#: scenario7:scenario7_66D50F4F_4564_4159_9ED0_8DCE33771C7F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 91074ee65b8ccbd600f8093d1c3c2c5af8a8a7aee44dc3be29613a91d1fa430d
